n\n\n**What was reviewed:** 7 new files (4 source, 3 test) implementing closed Malli schemas, pure catalog admission, and deterministic verdict aggregation for evidence-review lanes. All files are new; no existing code modified.\n\n**Deterministic gate:** Exit 125 (prerequisite failure). Lint and test statuses failed. PR author acknowledges the connector environment cannot run the toolchain. Gate failure is environment-related, not code-introduced.\n\n**Production code (law + domain):** Structurally sound. Schemas are correctly closed, the verdict fold is order-independent, contradiction preservation works, forbidden tools are enforced, and producer/snapshot matching is strict. No defects found.\n\n### Confirmed blocking findings\n\n1. **`evidence_review_test.cljs` — wrong catalog argument type (all tests)**\n   Every test passes `required-lanes` (a set of keywords) as the catalog argument to `aggregate-verdict`, but the function expects a catalog map with `:catalog/version`, `:catalog/id`, `:catalog/required-lanes`, and `:catalog/lanes`. When receiving a set, `(:catalog/required-lanes #{...})` returns nil, `catalog-admissibility-errors` fails shape validation on the set, and `aggregate-verdict` throws before any assertion runs. **Fix:** construct a proper catalog map with lane profiles matching the test data.\n\n2. **`evidence_review_test.cljs` — missing `:producer/actor` in test helper**\n   The `lane-result` helper (line 48) omits the required `:producer/actor` key from the producer map. The `producer-schema` requires it. Every test-generated lane result would fail `valid-lane-result-shape?`. **Fix:** add `:producer/actor :eta-mu.agent/<lane>-reviewer` to the helper's producer map.\n\n### Confirmed non-blocking finding\n\n3. **`evidence_lane_catalog_test.cljs` — wrong key path for actor uniqueness**\n   Line 16 uses `(:lane/actor lanes)` but the schema has `:lane/producer` (a nested map). The actor uniqueness check passes vacuously on nils. Same wrong key at lines 36-37. **Fix:** use `(mapv #(get-in % [:lane/producer :producer/actor]) lanes)`.\n\n### Verdict\n\n**REQUEST_CHANGES.** The two critical test defects prevent the test suite from passing, which is a merge gate. The production code is well-structured and correct. Fix the test data and the test suite should pass.","submittedAt":"2026-09-01T21:30:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit":{"oid":"8c27f2ddda691074e14982780a3f90922f804842"}}],"statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-01T21:13:46Z","conclusion":"FAILURE","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/open-hax/eta-mu/actions/runs/33559455822/job/100028280716","name":"bundle","startedAt":"2026-09-01T21:09:37Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Sandbox bundle"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-01T21:10:30Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/open-hax/eta-mu/actions/runs/33559456030/job/100028167181","name":"Analyze (javascript-typescript)","startedAt":"2026-09-01T21:09:19Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CodeQL"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-01T21:09:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/open-hax/eta-mu/actions/runs/33559456160/job/100028167436","name":"Send GitHub event to Discord","startedAt":"2026-09-01T21:09:14Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"GitHub Events to Discord"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-01T21:13:50Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/open-hax/eta-mu/actions/runs/33559890450/job/100029581332","name":"Send GitHub event to Discord","startedAt":"2026-09-01T21:13:47Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"GitHub Events to Discord"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-01T21:18:51Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/open-hax/eta-mu/actions/runs/33560362929/job/100031099158","name":"Send GitHub event to Discord","startedAt":"2026-09-01T21:18:46Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflow